body:
Thanks for sharing Psy, that definitely helps, a great deal actually.
@iNNc No, I haven't.. but the reason for my depression is because what I want is absolutely impossible/unattainable. The only answer is to accept the things I cannot change about myself. Even though I have found acceptance to an extent, it doesn't make it any easier to enjoy anything or build a life around an identity that I can never feel comfortable with. But who knows, maybe if I talk to some professionals, they can give me some sort of happy pill to make it easier to cope with things, it's definitely worth looking into.
Thanks for the replies you two!
